    "storyTitle": "Warm Earth & Tinted Light in 90 Centimetres: TERRA 90 Compact Sand Beige Barista Station",
    "storyLead": "When a compact kitchen nook, study alcove, or open-plan flat calls for a softer, more organic palette than pure white, TERRA 90 delivers our signature 90-centimetre smoked-glass barista architecture in warm, timeless sand beige full MDF.",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "Compact furniture often makes the mistake of shouting for attention or looking purely utilitarian. TERRA 90 takes the opposite path: quiet, tactile luxury within a disciplined 90 by 45 centimetre footprint. Dressed from plinth to cornice in a low-sheen sand beige membrane over 18-millimetre Grade-A full MDF, it brings the calming warmth of natural stone and travertine into British kitchens, dining corners, and home offices. At the top of the 205-centimetre silhouette, twin black-framed smoked glass doors introduce a crisp architectural contrast that immediately elevates the cabinet from simple storage to a piece of contemporary interior design.",
      "Switch on the integrated warm LED lighting inside the upper smoked-glass vitrine and watch how the sand beige interior and dark tinted glass interact. Unlike harsh cold-white lighting on stark white melamine, the warm LED glow against sand beige creates a golden, café-like atmosphere that flatters handmade ceramics, stoneware mugs, and glass bean jars. Directly beneath the upper cabinet, the open preparation alcove gives you 86 centimetres of internal width, 43 centimetres of net worktop depth, and a full 65 centimetres of vertical clearance—ensuring that even tall espresso machines, top-filling bean hoppers, and gooseneck kettles operate without a hint of cramped headroom.",
      "Below the worktop, TERRA 90 keeps its lines utterly clean with a handleless full-width drawer and twin lower cupboard doors. The drawer glides on heavy-duty damped telescopic runners, swallowing up portafilters, tampers, coffee scales, capsules, and tea infusers in complete silence. Beneath it, the two-tier base cupboard provides generous concealed storage for milk cartons, syrups, and dry larder goods. Because every panel is precision-cut from 18-millimetre full MDF rather than chipboard, TERRA 90 stands rock-steady and moisture-resistant through years of daily espresso preparation."
    ],
    "seoHighlights": [
      "Compact 90 × 45 × 205 cm single-module coffee corner in warm sand beige 18 mm full MDF with LED-illuminated black-framed smoked glass upper doors.",
      "86 × 43 cm net worktop with 65 cm vertical clearance to accommodate tall bean-to-cup espresso machines, grinders, and pour-over equipment.",
      "Handleless contemporary fascia featuring a full-width damped telescopic accessory drawer and a double-door concealed base cupboard."
    ],
