    "storyTitle": "Architectural Oak & Smoked Glass for Left-Entry Spaces: The Story of NATURA 130 RIGHT",
    "storyLead": "Designed for rooms where the main walkway or kitchen island approaches from the left, NATURA 130 RIGHT places its open natural oak-grain barista deck on the left wing and anchors the right corner with a 205-centimetre floor-to-ceiling smoked glass vitrine.",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "When you place a piece of timber furniture in a room, the way light falls across the wood grain and glass determines whether the space feels cramped or expansive. NATURA 130 RIGHT is configured specifically for walls where circulation arrives from the left-hand side. By keeping the left-hand 90-centimetre barista bay open at waist height and positioning the full-height 40-centimetre black-framed smoked glass column on the right flank, it preserves an open, airy sightline across the room while giving you an immediate, ergonomic worktop for preparing espresso and filter coffee.",
      "Step closer and the material richness of NATURA 130 RIGHT becomes unmistakable. Every panel of the 18-millimetre Grade-A full-MDF carcass is finished in a tactile, natural oak grain whose vertical lines draw the eye smoothly from the plinth up to the 205-centimetre cornice. Above the 65-centimetre-tall preparation alcove—and running down the entire 205-centimetre height of the right-hand tower—black-framed smoked glass doors filter the integrated warm LED lighting into a soft, golden glow. Against the oak-grained interior shelves, porcelain espresso cups, stoneware jugs, and crystal stemware look warm, curated, and completely protected from dust.",
      "Beneath the 86 by 43 centimetre preparation surface, a full-width handleless drawer on damped telescopic steel runners keeps your tamper, knock box, digital scales, filters, and teaspoons neatly marshalled. Below the drawer, twin flush oak-grain doors open to reveal a deep lower cupboard for reserve coffee beans, oat milk cartons, and entertaining platters. And thanks to its separable two-module construction (90 cm barista station + 40 cm right full-height vitrine), NATURA 130 RIGHT manoeuvres easily through British doorways and adapts effortlessly if you ever re-layout your home."
    ],
