    "storyTitle": "The Flagship All-White 140 cm Freestanding Barista Dresser: BIANCA 140 RAISED with Dual Sockets",
    "storyLead": "Crowning our collection at number thirty-two, BIANCA 140 RAISED unites an expansive 140-centimetre pure white membrane-MDF carcass, freestanding raised legs, touch-sensor LED lighting, and two built-in power sockets into the ultimate monochrome British kitchen-diner centrepiece.",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "For homeowners who adore the bright, architectural calm of an all-white British kitchen or dining room—yet demand the full 140-centimetre width and multi-appliance power of a grand hospitality dresser—BIANCA 140 RAISED is the definitive choice. Spanning 140 centimetres wide by 45 centimetres deep and standing 210 centimetres tall on raised architectural legs, it offers the storage capacity of a four-door butler’s pantry while maintaining the light, poised footprint of freestanding furniture. Every carcass panel, shelf, drawer front, and shaker-profiled door is crafted from 18-millimetre Grade-A membrane MDF in pure matt white, accented by crisp matt black cup handles and knobs.",
      "The 140-centimetre-wide open preparation bay is engineered to handle the busiest morning rush and the largest weekend dinner party alike. With two flush-mounted electrical sockets built directly into the cabinet and a touch-sensor LED task lighting bar recessed overhead, you can run a dual-boiler espresso machine, a dedicated grinder, and a kettle or microwave side by side without a single trailing extension cable. One tap on the touch sensor bathes the entire 140-centimetre pure white alcove in crisp, shadow-free daylight illumination. Above the worktop, four clear-glazed shaker doors showcase your porcelain, crystal stemware, and specialty coffee jars across an expansive glass gallery.",
      "Beneath the 140-centimetre worktop, two wide, symmetrical drawers on damped telescopic steel runners provide effortless waist-high storage for portafilters, tampers, coffee capsules, cutlery, and linens. Below the twin drawers, four panelled lower cupboard doors open to reveal a full-width four-bay larder—while the raised legs underneath allow air, light, and robot vacuums to pass freely beneath the entire 140-centimetre suite."
    ],
